{"unit_id":"Oxmyxo__dsh-markji-bridge#card-zh","repo":"Oxmyxo/dsh-markji-bridge","commit":"5dba616b05f656cdd35afb9eb65b8b09140d5852","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-markji-bridge 是面向 DSH agent 的 Markji（墨墨记忆卡）桥接插件：它注册卡组、卡片、同步和文件四类工具，并用本地 SQLite 缓存保存卡片及待处理修改。agent 可以筛选和读取卡片，批量新建、更新、移动或归档，也能查看 Markji 语法、上传文件并处理同步冲突。写入会先进入本地队列，再由同步工具或空闲自动同步推送。适合希望在 DSH 中整理和检索记忆卡的用户；需要 Markji OpenAPI Key，并需要 Node.js 22.13 及以上版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:256-280","lib/tools.js:21-23","lib/sync.js:1-8"]}
{"unit_id":"Oxmyxo__dsh-markji-bridge#card-en","repo":"Oxmyxo/dsh-markji-bridge","commit":"5dba616b05f656cdd35afb9eb65b8b09140d5852","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Connect DSH agents to Markji using deck, card, sync, and file tools. The local SQLite cache stores cards and queued edits. Agents can search, edit in batches, archive cards, upload files, and resolve sync conflicts. Sync runs manually or while idle. Requires a Markji OpenAPI key and Node.js 22.13+.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:256-280","lib/tools.js:21-23","lib/sync.js:1-8"]}
