{"unit_id":"Oxmyxo__dsh-markji-bridge#feature-1","repo":"Oxmyxo/dsh-markji-bridge","commit":"5dba616b05f656cdd35afb9eb65b8b09140d5852","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-markji-bridge 的功能「卡组与章节管理」：查看卡组和章节列表及详情，并新建、重命名或排序章节。调用 markji_decks 工具选择对应 action，数据通过本地缓存读取，修改排队后等待同步。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:1188-1205"]}
{"unit_id":"Oxmyxo__dsh-markji-bridge#feature-2","repo":"Oxmyxo/dsh-markji-bridge","commit":"5dba616b05f656cdd35afb9eb65b8b09140d5852","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-markji-bridge 的功能「卡片搜索与批量编辑」：按条件筛选和读取卡片，也可批量创建、更新、移动或归档。调用 markji_cards 工具传入 action 与卡片数据；写入先进入本地队列，正文会执行语法和媒体预检。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:1241-1270"]}
{"unit_id":"Oxmyxo__dsh-markji-bridge#feature-3","repo":"Oxmyxo/dsh-markji-bridge","commit":"5dba616b05f656cdd35afb9eb65b8b09140d5852","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-markji-bridge 的功能「后台同步与冲突解决」：启动拉取或推送任务，查看进度、失败信息和冲突，并选择策略解决冲突。调用 markji_sync 工具；任务可等待或恢复，空闲自动同步也可推送队列。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:1330-1375"]}
{"unit_id":"Oxmyxo__dsh-markji-bridge#feature-4","repo":"Oxmyxo/dsh-markji-bridge","commit":"5dba616b05f656cdd35afb9eb65b8b09140d5852","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-markji-bridge 的功能「Markji 文件操作」：上传文件或按文件 id 查询远端文件信息。调用 markji_file 工具并选择 upload 或 query；文件操作经 Markji OpenAPI 执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:21-23"]}
